<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-012-A habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.540362" lon="-121.114515"><name>SC26-012-A</name><desc>West White Rock complex Strong relief and closely spaced rock highs west of White Rock SMCA. Terrain A 93/100; not catch probability. Center 96 ft; nearby 47–131 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 625 m outside White Rock SMCA; the 100 m circle leaves about 525 m. Survey gap about 200 m from marker. Near a source-coverage edge; checked 100 m circle is complete. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-107</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.54199198251036" lon="-121.11784081615909"/><trkpt lat="35.5418932563729" lon="-121.11729162451496"/><trkpt lat="35.54117059429592" lon="-121.11719822043945"/><trkpt lat="35.54098347039679" lon="-121.11676140104323"/><trkpt lat="35.54071311791198" lon="-121.11676772311347"/><trkpt lat="35.540626445005564" lon="-121.1169903460326"/><trkpt lat="35.540638497902464" lon="-121.11776215086107"/><trkpt lat="35.5400943494645" lon="-121.11755427380645"/><trkpt lat="35.539993900194546" lon="-121.11689483847931"/><trkpt lat="35.54017241290298" lon="-121.11678036700134"/><trkpt lat="35.54016724534574" lon="-121.11644959554785"/><trkpt lat="35.54043759780555" lon="-121.11644327253721"/><trkpt lat="35.54043242929047" lon="-121.11611250005909"/><trkpt lat="35.53989172446023" lon="-121.11612514821374"/><trkpt lat="35.539808497975955" lon="-121.11656828274674"/><trkpt lat=